  "dn30:2.1.5": "",
  "dn30:2.1.6": "The banyan tree is not just proportioned, it offers shelter to many creatures. Touching the knees indicates connecting with the manyfolk, who at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.196/en/sujato#3.1'>AN 5.196:3.1</a> are likened to caterpillars reaching the knees. ",
  "dn30:2.2.1": "",
