  "dn30:2.4.5": "",
  "dn30:2.4.6": "A <i lang='pi' translate='no'>khema</i> is a sanctuary where animals flourish in peace, without fear of the hunter. Likewise, the Buddha’s body flourishes and has a fullness to it. He is slim but not skinny. ",
